 Interview Guidance Program - https://vajiramandravi.com/all-course...\n👉 UPSC Prelims Test Series - https://vajiramandravi.com/all-course...\n👉 UPSC Mains Test Series - https://vajiramandravi.com/all-course...\n👉 UPSC Optional Coaching - https://vajiramandravi.com/all-course...\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nVajiram And Ravi Most Popular Series For UPSC Preparation:\n👉 Vajiram and Ravi Flash News -    • FLASH NEWS   \n 👉 Vajiram and Ravi UPSC CSE 2024 Toppers' interactions-    • UPSC CSE 2024 TOPPERS  \n👉 Vajiram And Ravi Perspective -    • VAJIRAM AND RAVI PERSPECTIVE  \n👉 Vajiram And Ravi Simplified -    • Vajiram and Ravi Simplified  \n👉 Vajiram And Ravi : The Analyst -    • VAJIRAM AND RAVI: THE ANALYST  \n👉 Vajiram And Ravi Podcast -    • Vajiram And Ravi Podcast  \n👉 UPSC Topper Interview -    • UPSC CSE 2023 Toppers Talk  \n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nOur Social Media Handles:\n👉 YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/c/vajiramandr...\n👉 Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/vajiramandr...\n👉 Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/vajiramandra...\n👉 WhatsApp - https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va5K...\n👉 LinkedIn -   / vajiram-and-ravi  \n👉 Telegram - https://t.me/vajiramandraviofficial\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAbout Vajiram And Ravi:\n\nM/S Vajiram & Ravi is India’s well-known Institute and the Best IAS Coaching in India preparing candidates for the Civil Services Examination at all three levels – UPSC Preliminary Test, UPSC Main Examination and Personality Test. Since its inception, the Institute has helped over 5000 students to enter the Civil Services including IAS, IFS, IPS and other Central Services.\n\nTo know about our upcoming courses, visit https://vajiramandravi.com/\nFor Daily News, CA MCQs & Mains Answer Writing, visit: https://vajiramias.com/\nFor queries, contact us at Delhi: 080-6220-6330, Chenn